{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「永遠的小倩」之稱的王祖賢息影多年後定居加拿大，近年在溫哥華開設艾灸館，生活相當低調。近日她透過社交平台分享一段Vlog，公開近況與日常作</p><p>近日她透過社交平台分享一段Vlog，公開近況與日常作息，再度引發粉絲關注。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647897869586432964813.png/jpW6VlaFLx4GQLkFbfMynLpsCmT7CMo40zbJPNM2yTw\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><p>點擊查看王祖賢分享的日常：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647206555881472812374.png/c_XJ4-vCV_XHk2jy5LoPkVvcRxOb8D_JYiZv52Imb-c\" alt=\"王祖賢在小紅書分享自己的美好日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢在小紅書分享自己的美好日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647895516450816593671.png/nQmzy1kgbUVnqtJHl2s2iKDVZPhjytNCvtsdI77bHSM\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647900495351808072946.png/u7j1bDR7spK9r012ldyQqu8x3BExFref_4vSx_-L0sc\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647903045619712893217.png/0UGBciv5PyMaj45DaO_mBqvVXocYarjNcxGpKHMRqSg\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647905436504064167309.png/45zGxAi_hlkvFyDRNr98CqezEVkVzyp3iJx2poicdqY\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647894484652032786594.png/yIl2BqsUW6WrNjelNg8BGL6LAL0AZDd_y6RPfsukT34\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647897013948416356401.png/Ulf9gb9QE3Tky4oc-BoC1w53WAa65YavUdrG21Haxts\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647899450970112491863.png/ziTJNlcmSGVz2sdd8kB1-XL_aCg42IQepR_786Uf-_M\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647901946712064017653.png/wmqYtimulZsMEVttG8-bHsn-XHgqac9Tr94T3a_eE90\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647904325013504365490.png/64XDs13FstInvr8-PnAwOoGjjDSY0VLkC9nozQvZ6M0\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647610836455424267945.png/ZjUwCG6KlKZrfcKOq0Jr7cqktL1tw4NhwATTysAE08o\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647613701296128523796.png/4gjF23EpdedO3J0zpN_rc9AlaNHPU7GeCVutTwlbrU8\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647616201232384462390.png/EbgQRaoeF66i2g6MMeEn3eHLdhhG_g2M6FdmTehXZk0\" alt=\"王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）\"><figcaption>王祖賢分享的日常。（小紅書@王祖賢Joey）</figcaption></figure><p>59歲王祖賢在小紅書上傳影片，記錄平凡卻愜意的一天。畫面中，她留著一頭飄逸長髮，赤腳漫步海邊，雖身穿牛仔褲，依舊可見修長纖細的身形，狀態保養得宜。此外，她也帶著愛犬「智悟」享受加拿大生活，一人一狗在草地上共享冰淇淋，王祖賢還自在趴在草地上放鬆身心，享受無人打擾的單身日常，畫面相當療癒。</p><p>她在影片中感性表示：</p><p>字句間流露對當下生活的滿足，也讓不少粉絲直呼女神依舊優雅迷人。</p><p>延伸閱讀：王祖賢舊照出土　少女時期打籃球照瘋傳　網民：完勝赤木晴子</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250819/1034534618474221568502384.png/X7c9euEJi6n9b_9EYUBYyg8s_UvrD7SHI0TeiyNE3os\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：王祖賢舊照出土　少女時期打籃球照瘋傳　網民：完勝赤木晴子】王祖賢擁有173厘米的高挑身材。（Facebook圖片）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：王祖賢舊照出土　少女時期打籃球照瘋傳　網民：完勝赤木晴子】王祖賢擁有173厘米的高挑身材。（Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250819/1034534665681113088102857.png/Ihujy-MWnHTl1zp0jqxmanRSxy5tAydXe24-3XtuPt0\" alt=\"王祖賢的打籃球的照片日前出土。（Facebook圖片）\"><figcaption>王祖賢的打籃球的照片日前出土。（Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241016/923199988287672320541926.jpeg/4lGkMDHVDzAJHenS8bUhhTt-3eykoV81iIlMo4iJTKM\" alt=\"王祖賢（CFP）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（CFP）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241016/923199985997451264612937.jpeg/W7qICAA43Pwv3W7GQBB6S8MKQP5Ef6EeCMm2bwjJtm8\" alt=\"王祖賢（CFP）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（CFP）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241016/923199983916945408963185.jpeg/m9XxNcmGxHdekHXxHMR0cQxIYRkGgX2L5Q6TO-UOkzs\" alt=\"王祖賢（CFP）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（CFP）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241016/923199978967404544760538.jpeg/ce4EFokG5xDOTPNem5LXbNUQmlGWS0VlAv065QL9OuU\" alt=\"王祖賢（CFP）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（CFP）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241016/923199981635112960560189.jpeg/1UcEEIHUviXaHZG6HgCvOzwdHUmkRHEGaFsOU2hbDlM\" alt=\"王祖賢（CFP）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（CFP）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4244838/org/2d74b730340dd272a857f3b375cf83e8.jpg/NUC8qI1iE1oN_qI2gyzj4rKDXDnsm2yDQAc7GEAHOxg\" alt=\"當年因為王祖賢叫張國榮做哥哥，後來整個劇組都跟着叫，就連大家都跟着一起這樣叫了。（電影劇照）\"><figcaption>當年因為王祖賢叫張國榮做哥哥，後來整個劇組都跟着叫，就連大家都跟着一起這樣叫了。（電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241016/923199981081464832869240.jpeg/xh_81Q846cWmcdKkRnoLPqQdZ1sBz6xfQC0QIkAtECI\" alt=\"王祖賢（CFP）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（CFP）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4244835/org/10cea50bee21aac0074cc49379ea8955.jpeg/cuDQ8nJ4K9_oncWy7UOTXHalVcKWPpZgD_FK9w_xSvc\" alt=\"當年因為王祖賢叫張國榮做哥哥，後來整個劇組都跟着叫，就連大家都跟着一起這樣叫了。（電影劇照）\"><figcaption>當年因為王祖賢叫張國榮做哥哥，後來整個劇組都跟着叫，就連大家都跟着一起這樣叫了。（電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4244837/org/887ac9db4192a7c1395f178edbaceca7.jpg/YQRg8YGmFfNQw4jD7ZCSDw7KIV6vkNWCElqzvBJas7w\" alt=\"當年因為王祖賢叫張國榮做哥哥，後來整個劇組都跟着叫，就連大家都跟着一起這樣叫了。（電影劇照）\"><figcaption>當年因為王祖賢叫張國榮做哥哥，後來整個劇組都跟着叫，就連大家都跟着一起這樣叫了。（電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/366352/org/00e89d43efe236baf9a582881b6e080c.jpg/r_CsES7y3plqceHemPKeeoK10yxxPMF7nJlUApyZVAI\" alt=\"王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1280375/org/51ab173bf4772c459e0ed48efaa25e7b.jpg/bpWluH6BM32THpb5_TYgnlupBVHTq1OKRpjJlUaYyZU\" alt=\"王祖賢（視覺中國）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（視覺中國）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1528066/org/3dab7f17e300c7244ba0bc150766a8a1.jpg/vFLa5-YHeuxGBD1lMQramxDEOEfdJMowWhwXNlocFzY\" alt=\"王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1528065/org/b1622eb163d04de0fb4947e462f57c8d.jpg/6t0ftIQxjiKE6qjH3TbDoHfDahFUWjEAIZlRIyGZUSM\" alt=\"王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）\"><figcaption>王祖賢（《倩女幽魂》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2044928/org/a12f96e0d4d0776a1f1ef97374153d34.jpg/qmbnWd8n_P-XCImLRVw-5o3wMXku8q0NyL3tqci97ak\" alt=\"王祖賢與張曼玉在電影中的白娘子與小青扮相，堪稱經典。（《青蛇》劇照）\"><figcaption>王祖賢與張曼玉在電影中的白娘子與小青扮相，堪稱經典。（《青蛇》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2888342/org/46d994d677c740d475b1cf82754d23cd.jpg/G3rgnRGPjkMJEFTKtXpuHAKt61g1X3H_0JTvTdCU700\" alt=\"王祖賢年輕時已見頭髮濃密。（《千年女妖》劇照）\"><figcaption>王祖賢年輕時已見頭髮濃密。（《千年女妖》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2888344/org/a7c9e8ded87ffa91a315ac07a2476fe4.jpg/C1GajoyAxSxXxJr69z6j7pW-m8eNboP1DNCeDwzQng8\" alt=\"王祖賢頭髮濃密更如假髮一般。（《大丈夫日記》劇照）\"><figcaption>王祖賢頭髮濃密更如假髮一般。（《大丈夫日記》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2888357/org/3af0097429c5